menu "JD9366 example"

    config EXAMPLE_JD9366_DIRTY_LANDSCAPE
        bool "Use double-buffered PPA landscape presentation (RGB565)"
        default n
        help
            Rotate only the changed region needed by each DPI framebuffer.
            Requires ESP-IDF 6.1, RGB565 and PSRAM for three full-size buffers.
            Disable to use the original esp_lvgl_port display path.

endmenu
